    <bpmn:process id="W_W4805" name="W4805. Customer Pickup Journey, Notifications &amp; Support Escalation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Order ready (W4801); pickup event; customer needs help
Frequency: Per pickup + per support event
Volume: ~every locker pickup + ~support tickets
Owner: Locker Program Manager / CX (VS-13)
Participants: CX (VS-13), App (VS-75), Store Ops (VS-07), Customer
Source: workflow W4805 — Customer Pickup Journey, Notifications &amp; Support Escalation</bpmn:documentation>
