        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-723 (ensure controlled execution — Collection Operations, Replenishment &amp; Access Management (PA-164.2).) | - CTL-723: oversize eligibility rules + assist; refrigerated compartments monitored with shorter hold; spoilage dispositioned (VS-05.3)
Owner: Locker Program Manager / Store Ops (VS-07)</bpmn:text>
