Frequency: Continuous platform ops
Volume: ~all locker transactions across the network
Owner: Locker Program Manager / IT (VS-27) / Cyber (VS-27.3)
Participants: IT (VS-27), Ecommerce (VS-10), Loyalty/CRM (VS-13), Inventory (VS-05)
Source: workflow W4807 — ERP / Ecommerce / OMS / Loyalty Real-Time Integration Operations</bpmn:documentation>
