      <bpmn:userTask id="W4807_Task5" name="Operate the real-time integration: locker ↔ OMS (order/compartment/pickup…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Operate the real-time integration: locker ↔ OMS (order/compartment/pickup status VS-10), ↔ inventory (VS-05 — pickup decrements stock, returns increments/reverse), ↔ loyalty/CRM (VS-13/VS-126 — customer identity, points, NPS), ↔ app/notifications (VS-75), and ↔ 3P-carrier APIs (W4799); manage event-streaming reliability (&lt;30s latency per POS-013 pattern)
Responsible (R): IT / Ecommerce / Locker Platform
Accountable (A): Locker Program Manager / CIO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4807_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4807_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4807_Task6" name="Manage cybersecurity &amp; data (VS-27.3/VS-91): the locker platform is an…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Manage cybersecurity &amp; data (VS-27.3/VS-91): the locker platform is an IoT/customer-data system — network segmentation, API security, access-data protection, the recipient/customer PII classification, retention (VS-88), and breach readiness; manage the vendor as TPRM/IoT risk (VS-161)
Responsible (R): Cyber / Privacy / IT / TPRM
Accountable (A): CIO / DPO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4807_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4807_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4807_Task7" name="Monitor integration health, handle exceptions (desync between locker and OMS…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Monitor integration health, handle exceptions (desync between locker and OMS, failed status updates, duplicate events), and feed integration-quality metrics to analytics (W4815) and improvement (VS-133); manage change/releases per VS-27.1
Responsible (R): IT / Ecommerce
Accountable (A): Locker Program Manager / CIO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4807_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4807_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4807_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4807_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4807_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-723 (ensure controlled execution — Collection Operations, Replenishment &amp; Access Management (PA-164.2).) | - CTL-723: real-time integration with &lt;30s latency; locker/IoT segmented &amp; secured (VS-27.3); customer data classified (VS-91); vendor under TPRM (VS-161)
Owner: Locker Program Manager / IT (VS-27) / Cyber (VS-27.3)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
